 Look at **Subscriptions** in the portal menu. If you pay by subscription, the date moves forward after each successful payment. If something does not look right, tell the board.

+### The entrance display did not show my agenda
+
+Lift your fob away from the local reader and tap it again. WelcomePi needs an active fob linked to an active, unexpired membership. Check your expiration date on the portal Home page and your door scans in [Check-In Activity](/digital-makerspace/members/check-in-activity). If your door scan succeeded but the display stays on the board, tell the board when it happened so they can check the reader and the display connection.
+
+### The entrance display showed another welcome while I was reading
+
+A door arrival can replace an agenda immediately. A local tap that opens your character sheet or kudos gives you 30 seconds before a waiting door arrival takes over. Tap your fob to open your agenda again. You can also scan the portal QR code and use your own phone.
